00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:31.120
that transfers with Russia and national currencies are now possible.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.520
Sanctions still get in the way," he said, because banks on the other side will not fully

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:35.920
cooperate.

